<title>USA: TABLE-Adage Inc Q2 loss vs proft.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Adage Inc Q2 loss vs proft.</headline>
<dateline>WEST CHESTER, Pa. 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>3 Months</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr	  loss	   $0.06   profit	 $0.01</p>
<p> Net	  loss	     290			 75</p>
<p> Revs			 13,609		   11,614</p>
<p> Avg shrs		5,105,155		5,129,175</p>
<p>	  6 Months</p>
<p> Shr	 loss	   $0.12   profit	 $0.05</p>
