<p> Revs			23,069		   23,986</p>
<p> Avg shrs	     5,105,166		5,129,175</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company says during Q2 it sold off non-core businesses of its specialty manufacturing and paper manufacturing subsidiaries to concentrate on wireless communications.</p>
<p>-- Co said Q2 earnings from continuing operations were $142,000 versus $116,000 during the same period a year ago, and a $260,000 loss for the three months ending March 31, 1997.</p>
